  "-아/어 주다 (G039) = hacer algo en beneficio de otro; en 갖다줘요 el favor (llevar) va de ti hacia 도윤, y 도윤이한테 marca a quién. No es «que él te lo traiga a ti».": "-아/어 주다 (G039) = to do something for someone else's benefit; in 갖다줘요 the favor (bringing it) goes from you to 도윤, and 도윤이한테 marks the recipient. It does not mean that he brings it to you.",
